OL,3,GNEWSAZoo says sad farewell to Doris the
OL,4,Aarmadillo                              
OL,6,FA zoo in Telford has said goodbye to a 
OL,7,Fsix-banded armadillo called Doris, who 
OL,8,Flived to the grand old age of 19,      
OL,9,Fwinning a Blue Peter badge and helping 
OL,10,Fto educate thousands of visitors about 
OL,11,Fthe rainforest during her long life.   
OL,13,FAlong with her sibling Dillon, she     
OL,14,Fstarred in a short film for the Let's  
OL,15,FGo Club on CBeebies, and their 19th    
OL,16,Fbirthday was marked by BBC Newsround   
OL,17,Fearlier this year.                     
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,358,350,200,160,0,100
