OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4       
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSAZoo says sad farewell to Doris the
OL,4,Aarmadillo                              
OL,6,FThe pair had been on arthritis         
OL,7,Fmedication for some time - Dillon died 
OL,8,Fin June and on Sunday, Telford Exotic  
OL,9,FZoo announced Doris "couldn't carry on 
OL,10,Fany more".                             
OL,12,FScott Adams, the zoo's managing        
OL,13,Fdirector, said the pair had lived there
OL,14,Fsince it opened 15 years ago, adding   
OL,15,FDoris had been "an amazing ambassador".
